    description: "docs/schema.json's supply_chain_summary block declares a single property `by_tier` wrapping the per-tier counts, but the emitted behavior map places the tier keys one level higher (supply_chain_summary.<tier>) and never emits `by_tier`. `by_tier` has zero occurrences in the substrate. A schema-driven consumer reading supply_chain_summary.by_tier.* gets nothing. Fix: regenerate the supply_chain_summary schema shape to match the emitted top-level tier keys (drop the phantom by_tier wrapper). Related: WI-kutas (generic generate-schema drift). Surfaced via dogfooding; blinded severity 4/5."  # 2cf9
